<description>&lt;p&gt;The Indigenous Guard in Colombia has taken up arms against the new president's agenda, while President De la Espriella ordered a fifth bombing that killed nine ELN members. Ecuadorian authorities arrested four FARC dissident leaders on the border, linking cross-border rebel activity to the Colombian conflict. A drone strike injured six police officers at a Colombian police station, and a Black Hawk crash left thirteen soldiers stranded in Cauca. An illegal gold mine collapse in southwestern Colombia killed fourteen miners and injured seven, adding a civilian disaster to the ongoing armed violence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOM1ZPSi1KaUdRZUhlUXAxRXV5RUhCbk4tZXN3bXZOZDRpck5IeDNvcmNFc0w2bVNlbVlpb0JfWm1yOXBnZHJLU294cG5fTllGOGxsQXVJTTEtbkJSTVdPTE5VeE1TcjNkMkwwZ3o1a2dra0lkQXhrclNQSmhzRW1HSWRNLVZEbGdlX3JuTjZMY0xZZXZqZzM4dDFGZ3VRc1RHMUZrUGxSa1pBUUpIRFktS2NYcnpNM2xjb1ZES0l6Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Weekly Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQV0VYbEc3N09WUTFDcUwzLVpoeWtKSTAwckk3d3lxUkczVE9qVExXRVM1NlVwMk12V0JVS0o1dmtpMmxTbGh3WUh1SjJBTzBad295VGpuUE9ZV1lIRzNyalJ6OUpFMWI5azIwWFU4akFKU3Q2ZVVFQ2J4RlV6bGFMekVJdVBkd0JnTXBZSHl6aW5LOVh4RWJTNWlFbUgxcHgwY3loYXEzWHVKdGl2cXYtWTlkTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSEVmUzJSWmJtcWF4VW9VenRTNEVTbUR5ay1XbXNXeWtfRGw5c0hPRnYwY0FQYnEwSlNhLVNqdUxMUU53QUl2S1NmN01CRGlNRHFKelF4LW5iMWs3SHVJZ0RMbkJuS3JMbE9zQUIzYnpSZWpSRGViRjVPMEdCR0otODVBaWhodURnc0UwbWVBM0Z3QkwyWHQtSDE5dmZETUVKaVI4Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart New